__pycache__/

# Iris Engine reference photographs — 75 MB of CC-licensed macros, kept local.
# Fully refetchable: iris-engine/ref/refs.json carries the Commons page, the original URL,
# the licence and the author for each file (see also iris-engine/ref/ATTRIBUTION.md).
# Everything else under ref/ (refs.json, align.json, cases.json, bench-*.json) IS tracked.
iris-engine/ref/*.jpg
# …except the four isolated macros the published presets and the layer model are fitted to (credited in the app:
# Help ▸ Photo credits, read from ref/refs.json)
!iris-engine/ref/09-blue-green-isolated.jpg
!iris-engine/ref/25-green-amber-ring-isolated.jpg
!iris-engine/ref/26-green-crypts-isolated.jpg
!iris-engine/ref/35-grey-green-isolated.jpg

